1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:03,335
How many snowflakes will be left?

2
00:00:03,585 --> 00:00:05,104
Watch and guess!

3
00:00:06,504 --> 00:00:08,188
Five little snowflakes!

4
00:00:08,188 --> 00:00:10,196
One, two, three, four, five!

5
00:00:13,146 --> 00:00:14,839
One landed on my nose!

6
00:00:14,839 --> 00:00:16,396
Hee hee, it tickles!

7
00:00:18,246 --> 00:00:18,846
Drip!

8
00:00:19,046 --> 00:00:19,957
It melted!

9
00:00:19,957 --> 00:00:22,200
How many snowflakes are left?

10
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:25,245
Four!

11
00:00:28,195 --> 00:00:30,278
One fell on my nose!

12
00:00:30,278 --> 00:00:31,002
Drip!

13
00:00:31,202 --> 00:00:32,351
How many now?

14
00:00:32,351 --> 00:00:33,356
Count them!

15
00:00:35,356 --> 00:00:36,792
One, two, three!

16
00:00:36,792 --> 00:00:37,472
Three!

17
00:00:39,322 --> 00:00:42,148
Quack! One fell on my beak!

18
00:00:42,398 --> 00:00:44,975
Drip! How many are left?

19
00:00:46,975 --> 00:00:49,455
Two little snowflakes!

20
00:00:51,305 --> 00:00:52,847
Why do they all melt?

21
00:00:52,847 --> 00:00:53,939
Can you guess?

22
00:00:55,939 --> 00:00:57,763
Our noses are warm,

23
00:00:57,763 --> 00:00:59,420
and snow is cold!

24
00:00:59,670 --> 00:01:02,555
Warm makes snow go drip!

25
00:01:03,105 --> 00:01:05,470
Bye bye, little snowflakes!

26
00:01:06,020 --> 00:01:07,725
Share with a friend and

27
00:01:07,725 --> 00:01:09,888
subscribe to Honey Bunny Kidz!

28
00:01:10,388 --> 00:01:11,956
Watch the full story

29
00:01:11,956 --> 00:01:13,525
on Honey Bunny Kidz!
